<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <!--
        THE COSTED PRODUCTS BECOME GOODS.

        Everything the lab sells is a `service` today. That is why a database
        with twenty-six thousand orders and eighty-five thousand order lines
        holds not one manufacturing order: Odoo will not raise a job for a
        service, and a bill of materials cannot be written against one.

        The suite was built expecting otherwise. `sale_custom.action_confirm`
        has planned "the generated Manufacturing Orders (dental lab workflow)"
        since before this module existed, and `lab_workcenter_scan` is a station
        board for their work orders. Only the product type stood in the way.

        Fifteen products change, the ones *PRODUCTION DETAILS.xlsx* costs. Each
        gets Manufacture and Replenish on Order, so confirming a sale raises the
        job for that patient's case rather than for a forecast. `is_storable`
        stays off: the lab does not hold finished crowns, so a crown gets a job
        and a route but no quants and no valuation layer of its own.

        Before the bills of materials, because those point at these.
    -->
    <data noupdate="1">
        <function model="lab.masters.loader" name="make_anchors_manufacturable"/>
    </data>
</odoo>
